      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500002378722-System-Requirements this page makes it sound like VRC might function standalone on the original quest, it doesn't. A week or two after the given date in June 2023 it for sure 100% no longer worked on original quest. Personally I'm astounded at VRC's inability to say no to a group of users.\n\nWithin the current content limitations I've found vrchat to be a bit crash-happy even on the quest 3, so personally I'm happy to have a PC for PCVR. Yeah the quest 3 isn't as bad as the quest 2, but a lot of people have quest 2.\n\nI don't know if you ever saw the instructions for how those quest avatars had working flashlights. The instructions were posted to Reddit one day and I had two thoughts. First was that it was too complicated, and second was that the reason the instructions were made public was that vrchat was patching them out.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
