  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So I found out the flashlights have been disabled being unable to be added to your avatars and I was hoping we could bring that back for Quest 2 users I mean I get it it lags out and crashes original Quest Standalone users but the likelihood of finding a person on the original Quest standalone is very slim and it limits what quest 2, 3 and Quest 3S users are capable of doing",
